Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; GitHub repository (Reed Waller): https://github.com/sn1perm4n/scripts/tree/main/registry_files
; Disable Google Chrome from prompting to be the default browser (creates the key if it does not exist)

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome]
"DefaultBrowserSettingEnabled"=dword:00000000